 ==\n<!-- Include any relevant trivia here, including confirmed references by the devs (Example, The Specimen being a Dorohedoro reference, and different internal names (Example, Gold-Plated Cables being called Cables internally). Please do add sources for any trivia you add here!\n\nDo not add subjective opinion here like \"xyz potion is considered bad\".\n-->\n\n== Update History ==\n{{Update History Table/start}}\n{{Update History Table/row|Weekly 52|* Fixed issue that allowed player to throw Smoke Bomb in some rooms to no effect.}}\n{{Update History Table/row|Weekly 51|* Throwing a Smoke Bomb at the Final Act boss no longer crashes the game.}}\n{{Update History Table/row|Weekly 41|* Fixed Smoke Bomb and Colosseum bug that caused the player to go invisible.}}\n{{Update History Table/row|Weekly 35|* Updated Smoke Bomb's use text from Drink -> Throw.\n* Smoke Bomb now disables the end turn button so that enemies cannot attack you as you flee.\n* Smoke Bombs no longer trigger Come at Me achievement.}}\n{{Update History Table/row|Weekly 34|* Fixed Save and Quit Smoke Bomb exploit.\n* Using a Smoke Bomb no longer gives the Champion score bonus.}}\n{{Update History Table/row|Weekly 29|* Smoke Bombs now work when fighting monsters in ? rooms.}}\n{{Update History Table/row|Weekly 24|* New Rare Potion: Smoke Bomb.}}\n{{Update History Table/end}}\n\n{{PotionNav}}\n\n[[Category:Potions]] [[Category:ToUpdate]]"}}}]}}}}